## Risks / blockers

- Naming churn: avoid massive `public` rename first. Add projection helpers and migrate call sites.
- Security theatre: do not block Joel/operator x-ray just because the route is public. The important boundary is PlayerAgent capability input, not hiding useful monitor data from human observers.
- Source excerpt overreach: snippets are allowed, but agents should not dump large paid book chunks into the page.
- Existing state objects may not have new fields. Keep schemas default-compatible.
